CB013722_Cells_Frequency_Change_From_Wideband_To_Dualband_With_Cells_Block_Unblock
    [Documentation]     Purpose of this test case is to change cells frequency to force band mode switch from wideband
    ...                 to dualband with additional cells block and unblock to check their impact on band mode.
    ...
    ...       ARGS:
    ...       - initial_nrarfcns: dict with cells distnames and initial values of nrarfcns parameters
    ...       - band_mode_changing_nrarfcns: dict with cells distnames and band mode changing values of nrarfcns parameters
    ...       - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for all cells, example:
    ...                                    throughput_100MHz = {
    ...                                         '827736065':
    ...                                             {
    ...                                                 'throughput':
    ...                                                     {
    ...                                                         'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                         'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                     },
    ...                                                 'info': '-',
    ...                                                 'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                               },
    ...                      defaults to ${None} (L3 call will not be performed);
    ...       - l3_call_duration: duration of data transfer test in Robot time string format
    ...                        e.g. '1 minutes 42 seconds' or '1min 42s'; defaults to 30s
    ...       - protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to udp
    ...       - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M
    ...       - tput_verification_via_btslog: True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog,
    ...                                       False - throughput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to True
    ...       - ue_network_modes: dictionary with pairs of UE serial number - desired network mode e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...                           possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                           two in case of more than one UE); defaults to ${None} (current modes set on UEs will be used)

    [Arguments]                                                 ${initial_nrarfcns}
    ...                                                         ${band_mode_changing_nrarfcns}
    ...                                                         ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                                         ${l3_call_duration}=30s
    ...                                                         ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                         ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                         ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${True}
    ...                                                         ${ue_network_modes}=${None}

    ${bts_type}=                                                testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                              connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    Compare Cells Distnames From Dicts                          initial_nrarfcns=${initial_nrarfcns}
    ...                                                         band_mode_changing_nrarfcns=${band_mode_changing_nrarfcns}

    ${cells_distnames_list}                                     Get Dictionary Keys    ${initial_nrarfcns}
    ${rmod_id}=                                                 Get Rmod Id For Cells
    ...                                                         cells_distnames_list=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ${rmod_config_distname}=                                    admin_info_model.get_config_distname_for_rmod
    ...                                                         config_rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ${rmod_runtime_distname}=                                   admin_info_model.translate_rmod_distname
    ...                                                         rmod_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         output_distname_type=runtime
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    ${previous_nrarfcn_values}                                  Get Previous Nrarfcn Value
    ...                                                         cells_distnames_list=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ${previous_actBandModeSwitch_value}                         Get Previous ActBandModeSwitch Value
    ...                                                         dist_name=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Set Test Variable                                           ${return_to_initial_scf}
    ...                                                         ${True}

    Set Nrarfcn Value For Cells                                 cells_nrarfcns_values=${initial_nrarfcns}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Set ActBandModeSwitch For RMOD                              rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         param_value=false
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                                 30s
    ...                                                         5s
    ...                                                         Check Band Rmod Operation Mode
    ...                                                         rmod_runtime_distname=${rmod_runtime_distname}
    ...                                                         expected_band_rmod_mode=Wideband
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Set ActBandModeSwitch For RMOD                              rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         param_value=true
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                                 30s
    ...                                                         5s
    ...                                                         Check Band Rmod Operation Mode
    ...                                                         rmod_runtime_distname=${rmod_runtime_distname}
    ...                                                         expected_band_rmod_mode=Wideband
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Set Nrarfcn Value For Cells                                 cells_nrarfcns_values=${band_mode_changing_nrarfcns}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Wait For RMOD Reset And Check Status                        rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                                 30s
    ...                                                         5s
    ...                                                         Check Band Rmod Operation Mode
    ...                                                         rmod_runtime_distname=${rmod_runtime_distname}
    ...                                                         expected_band_rmod_mode=Dualband
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Block selected cells and check statuses                     cells_distname=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    Run Keyword If                                              ${throughputs}
    ...                                                         Execute L3 call
    ...                                                         attach_should_be_possible=${False}
    ...                                                         cells_distnames=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                         duration=${l3_call_duration}
    ...                                                         protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                         udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                         tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                         ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    Check selected BTS state and all RATs states                bts_status_variant=IntegratedToRan
    ...                                                         cells_blocked=${True}
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    Unblock selected cells and check statuses                   cells_distname=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    Run Keyword If                                              ${throughputs}
    ...                                                         Execute L3 call
    ...                                                         cells_distnames=${cells_distnames_list}
    ...                                                         throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                         duration=${l3_call_duration}
    ...                                                         protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                         udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                         tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                         ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    Check selected BTS state and all RATs states                bts_status_variant=OnAir
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    Set ActBandModeSwitch For RMOD                              rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         param_value=false
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Alarms.Allow alarm                                          fault_id=1900

    Wait For RMOD Reset And Check Status                        rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Waiting for FID 1900...
    ${is_1900_alarm_active}=                                    Wait for active alarm
    ...                                                         fault_id=1900
    ...                                                         timeout=180
    Should be True                                              ${is_1900_alarm_active}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                                 30s
    ...                                                         5s
    ...                                                         Check Band Rmod Operation Mode
    ...                                                         rmod_runtime_distname=${rmod_runtime_distname}
    ...                                                         expected_band_rmod_mode=Wideband
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Restoring previous actBandModeSwitch value...
    Set ActBandModeSwitch For RMOD                              rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                                         param_value=${previous_actBandModeSwitch_value}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Restoring previous nrarfcns values...
    Set Nrarfcn Value For Cells                                 cells_nrarfcns_values=${previous_nrarfcn_values}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                         Waiting for FID 1900 to disappear...
    ${is_1900_alarm_inactive}=                                  Wait for inactive alarm
    ...                                                         fault_id=1900
    ...                                                         timeout=180
    Should be True                                              ${is_1900_alarm_inactive}

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                       fault_id=1900